body.zh-TW:
在終端機中瀏覽落落長的回覆或比對異動時，畫面移動更加俐落。所有可捲動檢視全面改善了半頁捲動體驗，包含備用螢幕模式（altscreen，終端機獨立覆蓋主畫面的全螢幕互動介面）、差異比對檢視器與各類唯讀詳細資訊面板。在唯讀面板中按下 `ctrl+d` 快捷鍵，現在只會專心向下翻動半頁，不再誤觸退出確認對話框。同時新增了 `shift+up` 與 `shift+down` 作為預設的半頁導覽快捷鍵，分別對應 `navigation.half_page_up` 與 `navigation.half_page_down` 設定鍵，使用者也能依個人習慣自由重新綁定。⟦如同翻閱厚重樂譜時踩下翻頁踏板，輕踩一次就俐落捲動半頁樂譜，在只讀閱覽室裡也不會因為碰觸按鈕而突然熄燈關門。⟧

```
{
  "navigation": {
    "half_page_up": "shift+up",
    "half_page_down": "shift+down"
  }
}
```

body.en:
Navigating lengthy responses or inspecting diffs in the terminal is now much smoother. Half-page scrolling has been improved across all scrollable views, including altscreen mode, the diff viewer, and various read-only detail panels. Pressing `ctrl+d` in read-only panels now strictly scrolls down half a page instead of accidentally triggering the exit confirmation prompt. Additionally, `shift+up` and `shift+down` have been introduced as customizable default keybindings for half-page navigation, mapping to `navigation.half_page_up` and `navigation.half_page_down` respectively. ⟦It is like pressing a page-turn pedal while reading a heavy musical score: a single light tap neatly advances half a page, and touching a button inside a quiet reading room will no longer suddenly shut off the lights and lock the doors.⟧

```
{
  "navigation": {
    "half_page_up": "shift+up",
    "half_page_down": "shift+down"
  }
}
```
